      "title_sha256_16": "470a0a725268fb8c",
      "title_text": "Bank payments whose recipient the bank narration does not give: the recipient of each is not known",
      "limits_sha256_16": "c1f0b20d2bedd375",
      "limits_text": [
        "The narration of each payment listed names no one, carries a placeholder in place of the payee (such as \"Bank Acc\" for a transfer to an account, or \"PhonePe\" for a bill paid through it), or prints the payee in a form not read here. So these payments are counted under no payee and no s.194C limit is tested on them; one recipient may have been paid several of them."
      ],
